id: pm-web-jp0u
title: Make spawned test fixtures independent of ancestor package module type
description: "Extensionless Node fixtures containing require inherit an ancestor package.json type=module in a shared scratch tree, making extension, runner and project-route tests fail before exercising their assertions. An isolated CommonJS scratch root restores the affected 26-test subset. Use explicit CommonJS fixture filenames or local fixture metadata; retain real SDK acceptance on initialized trackers."
